.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
_tmp_3_*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime persisted store.
#
# artifacts/api-server/data/store.json is rewritten by the API server on every
# mutating request, so it is deliberately NOT tracked — it would dirty the
# working tree constantly.
#
# store.snapshot.json is the committed point-in-time restore copy (see
# CLAUDE_HANDOFF.md). To restore: copy it over store.json and restart the API.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
artifacts/api-server/data/*
!artifacts/api-server/data/store.snapshot.json

# Playwright (e2e/) outputs
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
